// Analytics build settings.
//
// The token is deliberately not committed — the web app keeps it in an env var and
// Android in a gitignored `local.properties`, and this is the iOS equivalent. An
// absent token is a supported state, not a broken one: `AnalyticsService` sees an
// empty string and no-ops, exactly as Android's `NoOpAnalytics` does, so a fresh
// clone builds and runs with analytics off.
//
// Precedence, lowest to highest:
//   1. the empty default below
//   2. Secrets.xcconfig, if present (gitignored; see README)
//   3. `xcodebuild MIXPANEL_TOKEN=…` on the command line, for CI
MIXPANEL_TOKEN =

#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
